              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">A taxiarch has a hand weapon, light armour and large shield. A Hipparch rides a horse (+11), or a Warhorse (+18) and has heavy armour and xyston. Used to Elephants. The mount may be half barded (+2) or barded (+4).</characteristic>
