            </profile>
            <profile id="a1ba-85c6-7deb-3cb0" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">The mahout is unarmed; the single crewman has hand weapon and pike. Up to two additional crewmen with hand weapon and javelins may be added (+9 each). All may have light armour (+2). One crewman may exchange javelins for composite bow (+1). If there is more than one crewman, the elephant is equipped with a howdah (+6) and shields may be attached to the outside (+2 per crewman). The howdah provides a 5+ save increased to 4+ by adding shields. An elephant with a howdah may also have barding (+8).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="18cb-85a0-4bec-76b3" name="Hand Weapon" hidden="false" targetId="a423-b782-e1ce-43e2" type="profile"/>
